l version's game folder.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0<strong> About Gameplay Videos</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feel free to share gameplay videos.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, please refrain from using in-game assets or media on their own, such as playing only the BGM without gameplay.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- Controls -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm \u2026\u2026 Left Click / Enter / Z<br>Cancel \u2026\u2026 Right Click / X<br>Quit Game \u2026\u2026 Esc<br>Toggle Fullscreen Mode \u2026\u2026 F4</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>- In-Stage Controls -</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move Cursor \u2026\u2026 Mouse / Arrow Keys<br>Open Menu \u2026\u2026 Left Click / Enter / Z on empty tile<br>Move/Attack \u2026\u2026 Left Click / Enter / Z on unit tile<br>Toggle Enemy Range \u2026\u2026 Right Click / X<br>Fast Forward \u2026\u2026 X</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25a0<strong>For those having trouble with a small window size</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to change the scaling settings in Windows:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open the Settings app:</strong><br>Click the <strong>Start menu</strong>, then click the <strong>Settings</strong> (gear icon).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select \u201cSystem\u201d:</strong><br>In the left-hand menu of the Settings window, click <strong>System</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select \u201cDisplay\u201d:</strong><br>In the System settings menu on the left, click <strong>Display</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Adjust the scale:</strong><br>Under <strong>Scale and layout</strong>, find the option <strong>&quot;Change the size of text, apps, and other items&quot;</strong>, then use the slider or select a value from the dropdown menu.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragr